{"id": "D014", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Raise a purchase order in the finance system before the business cards are delivered; invoices without a valid purchase order number will not be paid. If this is your first order with a new supplier, follow the supplier onboarding procedure before placing it. The handbook passages provided do not specify how to choose a supplier or place the business-card order.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s4:c1", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1"], "cited_text": {"SUP-501:v1.0:s4:c1": "Every order must have a purchase order raised in the finance system before the goods or services are delivered. Invoices without a valid purchase order number will not be paid; they are returned to the supplier.", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1": "Follow this procedure before placing a first order with any new supplier of goods or services, including hauliers and subcontractors."}, "cited_by_model": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s4:c1", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 5.323578489125826, "sections": ["SUP-501#4"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 4.476028733163196, "sections": ["HR-201#3"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s1:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 3.746734175396236, "sections": ["HR-202#1"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 3.4951773311207415, "sections": ["SUP-501#1"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 3.0533574322654533, "sections": ["HR-201#4"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 861, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 234, "reasoning_tokens": 117, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.00020310000000000003, "retrieval_ms": 0.1604999997653067, "generation_ms": 3538.819600000352, "total_ms": 3538.980100000117, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_eb0640e951e24df09c645878d8d53031", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D015", "status": "ok", "outcome": "insufficient_evidence", "answer": "The supplied passages do not say what time the canteen opens at Ashby Park.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": [], "cited_text": {}, "cited_by_model": [], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 11.089786867687565, "sections": ["FAC-402#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s2:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 5.56238064564726, "sections": ["OPS-103#2"]}, {"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 3.840903585004909, "sections": ["HR-204#1"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 3.802901966039045, "sections": ["OPS-103#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-101:v3.0:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 2.981926368208001, "sections": ["OPS-101#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 953, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 45, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.00011780000000000002, "retrieval_ms": 0.19559999964258168, "generation_ms": 1568.205300000045, "total_ms": 1568.4008999996877, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_68577a956b7a4c9aa6a98449a58abad6", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D016", "status": "ok", "outcome": "insufficient_evidence", "answer": "The supplied handbook passages do not state how many electric vehicle chargers are at the depots.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": [], "cited_text": {}, "cited_by_model": [], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 5.541513350418503, "sections": ["FAC-401#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-101:v3.0:s2:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 4.928353737787439, "sections": ["OPS-101#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s1:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 4.709719573089139, "sections": ["OPS-103#1"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 3.8902390408135124, "sections": ["FAC-401#2"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 3.889722827331311, "sections": ["SEC-302#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 987, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 46, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001217, "retrieval_ms": 0.2055000004475005, "generation_ms": 1778.255000000172, "total_ms": 1778.4605000006195, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_57e08eddb9b744e285c9fd65e3e08de5", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D017", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The emergency change must be reviewed retrospectively at CAB within 2 working days of implementation. The P1 post-incident review meeting must take place within 5 working days of the service being restored.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1", "OPS-101:v3.0:s7:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1": "An emergency change can be approved by the Duty Operations Manager and the system owner together. Approval can be given by phone but must be recorded in the ticket. Every emergency change must be reviewed retrospectively at CAB within 2 working days of implementation.", "OPS-101:v3.0:s7:c1": "Every P1 incident needs a post-incident review. The review meeting must take place within 5 working days of the service being restored. The system owner writes the review, which records the timeline, the root cause, what went well and the actions agreed, each with an owner and a due date. Reviews are stored with the incident ticket."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1", "OPS-101:v3.0:s7:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-101:v3.0:s7:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 25.654682995161558, "sections": ["OPS-101#7"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 18.391408332902746, "sections": ["OPS-102#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s4:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 15.266833701236266, "sections": ["OPS-102#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 13.37231039132544, "sections": ["OPS-102#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s6:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 10.571962062289494, "sections": ["OPS-102#6"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 992, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 89, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001437, "retrieval_ms": 0.42180000036751153, "generation_ms": 1879.2652000001908, "total_ms": 1879.6870000005583, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_1ee2511b58e54ab998ff6af402908928", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D018", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "A business trip outside the UK needs approval from a director before booking. You may work remotely from outside the UK for up to 10 working days in a calendar year, with your line manager’s approval.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-202:v2.0:s6:c1", "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-202:v2.0:s6:c1": "Trips outside the UK need approval from a director before booking. Check the travel advice for the destination and tell the Service Desk before you travel so that your laptop and phone will work abroad.", "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1": "You may work from outside the UK for up to 10 working days in a calendar year with approval from your line manager. Ask the Service Desk to check your laptop before you go. Working abroad for longer is not allowed, because of tax and employment law."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-202:v2.0:s6:c1", "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s6:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 23.193089547835427, "sections": ["HR-202#6"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 22.129161165581962, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 10.158054371331826, "sections": ["HR-203#6"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 8.386076677994785, "sections": ["HR-203#2"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 8.348087809993192, "sections": ["HR-202#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 916, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 90, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001366, "retrieval_ms": 0.4011000000900822, "generation_ms": 2103.601799999524, "total_ms": 2104.002899999614, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_bf95d1d5785046688ec0b23f03ea455c", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D019", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Accident book entries are kept for 3 years from the date of the entry. For contractors working at height, the site manager issues the permit to work.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1": "| Record | Retention period |\n|---|---|\n| Payroll records | 6 years after the end of the tax year they relate to |\n| Personnel files for leavers | 6 years after the leaving date |\n| Applications from unsuccessful candidates | 6 months after the recruitment decision |\n| Accident book entries | 3 years from the date of the entry |", "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1": "Contractors must complete the site safety induction before starting work. The induction is valid for 12 months at the site where it was completed. Contractors carrying out hot work, work at height or work on electrical systems need a permit to work issued by the site manager."}, "cited_by_model": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 18.81971196005688, "sections": ["FAC-401#2"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 10.95462891287681, "sections": ["SEC-302#3"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s1:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 7.923635491428498, "sections": ["SEC-302#1"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 7.177797157733663, "sections": ["FAC-401#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s1:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 7.132362809044805, "sections": ["OPS-105#1"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 902, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 81, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.00013069999999999998, "retrieval_ms": 0.35089999983028974, "generation_ms": 1718.027599999914, "total_ms": 1718.3784999997442, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_0876d1ed9ce84cec899a9fba8f87748c", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D020", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The manager must order the laptop at least 10 working days before the start date. Request system access through the service portal using the “System access” form.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1", "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1": "New starters receive their laptop and phone from the Service Desk on their first day. The line manager must order equipment at least 10 working days before the start date. Each item is recorded against the person's name with its asset tag.", "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1": "Request access through the service portal using the \"System access\" form. Requests are fulfilled within 2 working days of the final approval. Do not share your login with a colleague who is waiting for access."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1", "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 14.710512813340534, "sections": ["OPS-104#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 13.413937443123157, "sections": ["OPS-105#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s4:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 13.016376227916284, "sections": ["OPS-104#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 9.318171696796984, "sections": ["OPS-104#3"]}, {"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 9.140790058634092, "sections": ["HR-204#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 945, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 126, "reasoning_tokens": 43, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001575, "retrieval_ms": 0.45420000060403254, "generation_ms": 1981.1119999994844, "total_ms": 1981.5662000000884, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_18f2bad2c2fe497ead43bf16c13b07d6", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D021", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "No. Claims must be submitted within 60 days of when the cost was incurred. Later claims will not be paid unless the Finance Director agrees there were exceptional circumstances.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-201:v4.0:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-201:v4.0:s2:c1": "Submit claims through the expenses system within 60 days of the date the cost was incurred. Claims submitted later will not be paid unless the Finance Director agrees there were exceptional circumstances. Claims are paid with the next monthly payroll after approval."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-201:v4.0:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 19.53684743097067, "sections": ["HR-201#2"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s6:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 13.081129818349183, "sections": ["HR-201#6"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 11.42240983871595, "sections": ["HR-201#5"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s1:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 10.037818293607074, "sections": ["HR-201#1"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 9.079857202552393, "sections": ["FAC-401#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 864, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 70, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.00012140000000000001, "retrieval_ms": 0.2741999996942468, "generation_ms": 1926.7219000003024, "total_ms": 1926.9960999999967, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_5fae15d69de04f05b66ca74806ee08c6", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D022", "status": "ok", "outcome": "conflicting_evidence", "answer": "The handbook gives conflicting replacement cycles: HR-203 says laptops for hybrid workers are replaced every 3 years, while OPS-105 says laptops are replaced every 4 years.", "conflict_note": "HR-203 specifies every 3 years for hybrid workers; OPS-105 states every 4 years for laptops.", "citations": ["HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1": "The company provides a laptop, a monitor and a headset for hybrid workers. Laptops for hybrid workers are replaced every 3 years. If you leave Fernhollow, return all company equipment, including your laptop, within 10 working days of your last working day.", "OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1": "Laptops are replaced every 4 years and phones every 3 years, or earlier if they fail."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 15.77403179529281, "sections": ["HR-203#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 8.13719821218829, "sections": ["OPS-105#6"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s4:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 5.322652921165227, "sections": ["HR-203#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 4.808798213326594, "sections": ["OPS-105#5"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 4.736152209649285, "sections": ["HR-203#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 874, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 192, "reasoning_tokens": 80, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001834, "retrieval_ms": 0.21350000042730244, "generation_ms": 3115.3210999991643, "total_ms": 3115.5345999995916, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_8fc18de50a0a4193ad6f68ee5765e7a9", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D023", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The Change Advisory Board meets every Tuesday at 10:00.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s4:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-102:v2.0:s4:c1": "The CAB meets every Tuesday at 10:00. It is chaired by the Head of IT Operations and includes the system owners and a representative from depot operations. A change that is not reviewed at CAB cannot go ahead, except as an emergency change."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s4:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 16.55177798223782, "sections": ["OPS-102#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 9.49194564083558, "sections": ["OPS-102#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 8.727707608478308, "sections": ["OPS-102#5"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s6:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 6.493382277005139, "sections": ["SUP-501#6"]}, {"id": "SEC-301:v2.0:s3:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 4.544458902999943, "sections": ["SEC-301#3"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 955, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 132, "reasoning_tokens": 80, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001615, "retrieval_ms": 0.36019999970449135, "generation_ms": 2170.2953000003617, "total_ms": 2170.6555000000662, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_fde31c7199fa4cd781453fc10b67029c", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D024", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The Service Desk is open on Saturdays, from 07:00 to 19:00.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-101:v3.0:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-101:v3.0:s2:c1": "Report incidents to the IT Service Desk through the service portal or by phone on extension 4400. The Service Desk is staffed from 07:00 to 19:00, Monday to Saturday. Outside these hours, call the out-of-hours line on extension 4499, which pages the on-call engineer described in OPS-103.\nWhen you report an incident, give the site, the system affected, the time the problem started, how many people or vehicles are affected and any error message shown."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-101:v3.0:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-101:v3.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 6.9130286047278116, "sections": ["OPS-101#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-101:v3.0:s5:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 6.478998118505459, "sections": ["OPS-101#5"]}, {"id": "SEC-303:v1.2:s3:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 4.747584496737873, "sections": ["SEC-303#3"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s6:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 3.7914848796234315, "sections": ["HR-202#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s1:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 3.7914848796234315, "sections": ["OPS-103#1"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 980, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 93, "reasoning_tokens": 35, "embedding_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0001445, "retrieval_ms": 0.21050000032118987, "generation_ms": 3126.5287999995053, "total_ms": 3126.7392999998265, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_1f6a1761050641b8a2f9f34928e28e1a", "warnings": []}
